---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="wonders" title="Wonder Events" active="wonder-events" pageMark="🏛️">
  The decision pop-ups that can fire the moment you complete a <a href={`${base}wonders`}>Wonder</a> —
  dedicate the Ziggurat's terrace shrine, choose what the Lighthouse guides in, pick which family the
  Acropolis honors. Each card shows the wonder that triggers it and what every choice grants. Some
  roll a chance to appear (shown on the card); all are separate from the plain completion announcement,
  which always fires and grants +2/+4/+6/+8 Legitimacy by wonder tier. Building a wonder in its
  historical city (Pyramids in Memphis, Great Ziggurat in Ur, …) additionally pops a hidden
  Steam-achievement event with no in-game reward.
</EventGroupPage>
